      "improved_table_name": "service calendar",
      "table_name": "calendar",
      "text_embedding": "# Table: service calendar\n**Original Name**: calendar\n**Description**: This table represents service calendar\n**Column Count**: 10\n## Columns\n- **service identifier** (original: service_id) - Type: VARCHAR(50) - Examples: 4_I12, 4_I13, 4_I14 (identifier pattern)\n- **monday operation** (original: monday) - Type: TINYINT - Examples: 0, 0, 1 (numeric pattern)\n- **tuesday operation** (original: tuesday) - Type: TINYINT - Examples: 0, 0, 1 (numeric pattern)\n- **wednesday operation** (original: wednesday) - Type: TINYINT - Examples: 0, 0, 1 (numeric pattern)\n- **thursday operation** (original: thursday) - Type: TINYINT - Examples: 0, 0, 1 (numeric pattern)\n- **friday operation** (original: friday) - Type: TINYINT - Examples: 0, 0, 0 (numeric pattern)\n- **saturday operation** (original: saturday) - Type: TINYINT - Examples: 1, 0, 0 (numeric pattern)\n- **sunday operation** (original: sunday) - Type: TINYINT - Examples: 0, 1, 0 (numeric pattern)\n- **start date of service** (original: start_date) - Type: DATE - Examples: 2017-06-29, 2017-06-29, 2017-06-29 (date pattern)\n- **end date of service** (original: end_date) - Type: DATE - Examples: 2018-06-29, 2018-06-29, 2018-06-29 (date pattern)\n## Relationships\n- **service identifier** references **trips** table\n## Data Characteristics\n**Sample Size**: 5 rows\n**Uniqueness**: service_id (all unique), start_date (constant), end_date (constant)\n**Domain**: temporal data, transportation service"
    },
