      "improved_table_name": "public transportation stop schedules",
      "table_name": "stop_times",
      "text_embedding": "# Table: public transportation stop schedules\n**Original Name**: stop_times\n**Description**: This table represents public transportation stop schedules\n**Column Count**: 9\n## Columns\n- **trip identifier** (original: trip_id) - Type: VARCHAR(50) - Examples: 4_I12-001_2016I12_1_1_4__1___, 4_I12-001_2016I12_1_1_4__1___, 4_I12-001_2016I12_1_1_4__1___ (identifier pattern)\n- **scheduled arrival time** (original: arrival_time) - Type: VARCHAR(50) - Examples: 00:08:19, 00:22:04, 00:23:53\n- **scheduled departure time** (original: departure_time) - Type: VARCHAR(50) - Examples: 00:08:19, 00:22:04, 00:23:53\n- **stop identifier** (original: stop_id) - Type: VARCHAR(50) - Examples: par_4_1, par_4_10, par_4_11 (identifier pattern)\n- **stop sequence number** (original: stop_sequence) - Type: DECIMAL(10,2) - Examples: 3.0, 12.0, 13.0\n- **stop sign text** (original: stop_headsign) - Type: VARCHAR(255)\n- **passenger pickup type** (original: pickup_type) - Type: TINYINT - Examples: 0, 0, 0 (numeric pattern)\n- **passenger drop off type** (original: drop_off_type) - Type: TINYINT - Examples: 0, 0, 0 (numeric pattern)\n- **distance traveled along shape** (original: shape_dist_traveled) - Type: VARCHAR(255)\n## Relationships\n- **trip identifier** references **trips** table\n- **stop identifier** references **stops** table\n## Data Characteristics\n**Sample Size**: 10 rows\n**Uniqueness**: trip_id (constant), arrival_time (all unique), departure_time (all unique), stop_id (all unique), stop_sequence (all unique), pickup_type (constant), drop_off_type (constant)\n**Domain**: temporal data, transportation service"
    },
