      "improved_table_name": "List of bus stops",
      "table_name": "stops",
      "text_embedding": "# Table: List of bus stops\n**Original Name**: stops\n**Description**: This table represents list of bus stops\n**Column Count**: 12\n## Columns\n- **unique stop identifier** (original: stop_id) - Type: VARCHAR(50) - Examples: acc_4_1_1, acc_4_1_1040, acc_4_1_1043 (identifier pattern)\n- **stop code** (original: stop_code) - Type: TINYINT - Examples: 1, 1, 1 (numeric pattern)\n- **stop name** (original: stop_name) - Type: VARCHAR(50) - Examples: Plaza de Castilla, Ascensor, Intercambiador Superficie (identifier pattern)\n- **stop description** (original: stop_desc) - Type: VARCHAR(50) - Examples: Paseo de la Castellana 189, Plaza de Castilla 9, Paseo de la Castellana 191 B (identifier pattern)\n- **stop langitude** (original: stop_lat) - Type: DECIMAL(10,2) - Examples: 40.46682, 40.46555, 40.46728\n- **stop longitude** (original: stop_lon) - Type: DECIMAL(10,2) - Examples: -3.68918, -3.68877, -3.68915\n- **zone identifier** (original: zone_id) - Type: VARCHAR(255)\n- **stop url** (original: stop_url) - Type: VARCHAR(50) - Examples: http://www.crtm.es, http://www.crtm.es, http://www.crtm.es\n- **type of location** (original: location_type) - Type: TINYINT - Examples: 2, 2, 2 (numeric pattern)\n- **parent station** (original: parent_station) - Type: VARCHAR(50) - Examples: est_90_21, est_90_21, est_90_21 (identifier pattern)\n- **stop time zone** (original: stop_timezone) - Type: VARCHAR(255)\n- **wheelchair boarding availability** (original: wheelchair_boarding) - Type: TINYINT - Examples: 0, 0, 0 (numeric pattern)\n## Data Characteristics\n**Sample Size**: 10 rows\n**Uniqueness**: stop_id (all unique), stop_lat (all unique), stop_url (constant), location_type (constant), wheelchair_boarding (constant)"
    },
