{'table_name': 'routes', 'improved_table_name': 'list of transportation routes', 'column_names': ['route_id', 'agency_id', 'route_short_name', 'route_long_name', 'route_desc', 'route_type', 'route_url', 'route_color', 'route_text_color'], 'improved_column_names': ['unique route identifier', 'transportation agency identifier', 'short name of the route', 'full name of the route', 'description of the route', 'type of transportation route', 'uniform resource locator for the route', 'color associated with the route', 'text color used for the route'], 'text_embedding': '# Table: list of transportation routes\n**Original Name**: routes\n**Description**: This table represents list of transportation routes\n**Column Count**: 9\n## Columns\n- **unique route identifier** (original: route_id) - Type: VARCHAR(50) - Examples: 4__1___, 4__10___, 4__11___ (identifier pattern)\n- **transportation agency identifier** (original: agency_id) - Type: VARCHAR(50) - Examples: CRTM, CRTM, CRTM\n- **short name of the route** (original: route_short_name) - Type: TINYINT - Examples: 1, 10, 11 (numeric pattern)\n- **full name of the route** (original: route_long_name) - Type: VARCHAR(50) - Examples: Pinar de Chamartín-Valdecarros, Hospital del Norte-Puerta del Sur, Plaza Elíptica-La Fortuna (identifier pattern)\n- **description of the route** (original: route_desc) - Type: VARCHAR(255)\n- **type of transportation route** (original: route_type) - Type: TINYINT - Examples: 1, 1, 1 (numeric pattern)\n- **uniform resource locator for the route** (original: route_url) - Type: VARCHAR(255) - Examples: http://www.crtm.es/tu-transporte-publico/metro/lineas/4__1___.aspx, http://www.crtm.es/tu-transporte-publico/metro/lineas/4__10___.aspx, http://www.crtm.es/tu-transporte-publico/metro/lineas/4__11___.aspx (identifier pattern)\n- **color associated with the route** (original: route_color) - Type: VARCHAR(50) - Examples: 2DBEF0, 005AA9, 009B3A\n- **text color used for the route** (original: route_text_color) - Type: VARCHAR(50) - Examples: FFFFFF, FFFFFF, FFFFFF\n## Relationships\n- **transportation agency identifier** references **agency** table\n## Data Characteristics\n**Sample Size**: 10 rows\n**Uniqueness**: route_id (all unique), agency_id (constant), route_short_name (all unique), route_long_name (all unique), route_type (constant), route_url (all unique), route_color (all unique)\n**Domain**: transportation service', 'embedding': [0, -0.34375, 0.109375, 0.453125, 0, -0.265625, 0.046875, -0.4140625, 0.171875, -0.7890625, 0.34375, -0.234375, 0.171875, -0.015625, 0.7734375, 0.7109375, 0.6015625, -0.1015625, 0.6171875, 0.0078125, -0.078125, 0.328125, 0.0859375, -0.078125, 0.203125, 0.296875, 0.078125, 0.78125, 0.390625, 0.5703125, 0.46875, 0.046875, -0.5859375, -0.40625, -0.125, -0.53125, -0.046875, 0.1640625, -0.34375, 0.2734375, 0.2734375, -0.09375, 0.078125, 0.359375, -0.0703125, 0.4296875, 0.1953125, 0.6171875, -0.09375, 0.3515625, 0.1953125, -0.28125, -0.734375, 0.234375, 0.390625, -0.328125, 0.6171875, 0.1328125, -0.03125, 0.1015625, 0.28125, 0.203125, -0.5625, 0.6328125, 0.078125, -0.046875, 0.453125, 0.0234375, 0.40625, 0.1328125, -0.6171875, 0.15625, -0.1328125, -0.03125, 0.015625, 0.1953125, -0.34375, 0.3984375, -0.3984375, -0.203125, -0.109375, -0.53125, -0.2421875, -0.0390625, -0.3828125, 0.171875, -0.4453125, 0.03125, -0.3203125, 0.03125, -0.1328125, -0.140625, 0.40625, 0.6875, 0.0625, 0.1328125, 0.1953125, -0.109375, -0.15625, -0.4609375, -0.03125, -0.125, 0.078125, -0.46875, 0.2265625, 0.359375, 0.1484375, 0.171875, 0.390625, 0.3828125, -0.734375, -0.2890625, 0.46875, -0.4140625, -0.296875, 0.1953125, -0.1328125, -0.4375, -0.375, -0.0390625, -0.375, -0.3671875, 0.40625, 0.53125, -0.1953125, -0.7421875, -0.3046875, -0.1796875, -0.0703125, 0.0390625, -0.78125, 0.0546875, -0.1328125, 0.0859375, -0.21875, -0.4375, 0.3203125, -0.1171875, -0.078125, 0.0390625, -0.2421875, -0.03125, -0.171875, 0.1875, 0.1875, -0.5390625, 0.140625, -0.4609375, 0.1484375, 