      "text_embedding": "# Table: list of transportation agencies\n**Original Name**: agency\n**Description**: This table represents list of transportation agencies\n**Column Count**: 7\n## Columns\n- **agency identifier** (original: agency_id) - Type: VARCHAR(50) - Examples: CRTM\n- **name of agency** (original: agency_name) - Type: VARCHAR(50) - Examples: Consorcio Regional de Transportes de Madrid (identifier pattern)\n- **agency website url** (original: agency_url) - Type: VARCHAR(50) - Examples: http://www.crtm.es\n- **agency timezone** (original: agency_timezone) - Type: VARCHAR(50) - Examples: Europe/Madrid\n- **agency language** (original: agency_lang) - Type: VARCHAR(50) - Examples: es\n- **agency phone number** (original: agency_phone) - Type: TINYINT - Examples: 012 (numeric pattern)\n- **agency fare information url** (original: agency_fare_url) - Type: VARCHAR(50) - Examples: https://www.crtm.es/billetes-y-tarifas (identifier pattern)\n## Data Characteristics\n**Sample Size**: 1 rows\n**Uniqueness**: agency_id (all unique), agency_name (all unique), agency_url (all unique), agency_timezone (all unique), agency_lang (all unique), agency_phone (all unique), agency_fare_url (all unique)\n**Domain**: transportation service"
